THIS MESSAGE IS FOR YOU ✨🦋

👉🏼 What are archetypes & where do they come from? 

A psychologist by the name of Carl Jung was the first to develop and integrate the concept of archetypes into the world of psychology and healing 🌈 

On your journey through creativity, psychology and/or spirituality I’ve found these cards to be both playful and useful. 

It is said that all of the archetypes are inside of us and the ones we pull from the deck are the ones we’re being called to embody ✨

When I worked in learning & development I would use coaching cards throughout my workshops. Using a picture to reflect ignites your imagination which helps you reflect and tell a story, and more importantly, make sense of your own 💭 

They’re also amazing for journal prompts or contemplation. It’s fascinating what thoughts come up with when you combine them with vision & creativity 🧠👀

You’re not seeing this by accident.

What comes up for you? 🦋 

